sform: none; text-align: inherit; font-variant-numeric: normal;">Explore stocks on Coinbase </span>  </a> <button class="disclaimer-cta  yf-1j99lrp" data-ylk="sec:ticker-tag-module;subsec:cb-article-pill-cta;elm:ct;elmt:button;itc:1" data-yga="{&quot;yModuleName&quot;:&quot;ticker-tag-module&quot;,&quot;ySubModuleName&quot;:&quot;cb-article-pill-cta&quot;,&quot;yLinkElement&quot;:&quot;ct&quot;,&quot;yLinkElementType&quot;:&quot;button&quot;,&quot;yTrafficOrigin&quot;:&quot;ticker-tag-module cb-article-pill-cta&quot;}">   <span class="text  neo-font-label-sm-reg  yf-18d6y07" style="text-decoration: none; font-style: normal; text-transform: none; text-align: inherit; font-variant-numeric: normal;">Trading disclosure </span> <div aria-hidden="true" class="icon fin-icon inherit-icn sz-medium  yf-15ilbqr"><!-- HTML_TAG_START --><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M11 7h2v2h-2zm0 4h2v6h-2zm1-9C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.48 10 10 10 10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2m0 18c-4.41 0-8-3.59-8-8s3.59-8 8-8 8 3.59 8 8-3.59 8-8 8"/></svg><!-- HTML_TAG_END --> </div></button> <div class="tooltip al-bottom-end   yf-534r60" role="tooltip" style="--tooltip-z-index: 9;"><div class="arrow yf-534r60"></div>     <div slot="content" class="tooltip-content yf-1j99lrp">   <h2 class="text  neo-mb-3 neo-font-label-lg-emphasis  yf-18d6y07" style="text-decoration: none; font-style: normal; text-transform: none; text-align: inherit; font-variant-numeric: normal;">Trading disclosure </h2>    <p class="text  neo-mb-6 neo-font-paragraph-md-reg  yf-18d6y07" style="text-decoration: none; font-style: normal; text-transform: none; text-align: inherit; font-variant-numeric: normal;">The above button links to Coinbase. Yahoo Finance is not a broker-dealer or investment adviser and does not offer securities or cryptocurrencies for sale or facilitate trading. Coinbase pays us for certain activity generated through this link. Prices displayed are informational. </p>        <a aria-label="" role="link" id="" class="btn tertiary neo-px-4 neo-min-h-9 neo-min-w-13 neo-w-fit neo-gap-1 tw-self-end     yf-17a6rca" data-ylk="elm:ct;elmt:button;itc:1;sec:ticker-tag-module;subsec:cb-article-pill-cta" data-yga="{&quot;yLinkElement&quot;:&quot;ct&quot;,&quot;yLinkElementType&quot;:&quot;button&quot;,&quot;yModuleName&quot;:&quot;ticker-tag-module&quot;,&quot;ySubModuleName&quot;:&quot;cb-article-pill-cta&quot;,&quot;yTrafficOrigin&quot;:&quot;ticker-tag-module cb-article-pill-cta&quot;}" target="_blank" href="https://help.yahoo.com/kb/index?page=content&amp;y=PROD_FIN_DESK&amp;locale=en_US&amp;id=SLN37227">   <span class="text btn-content neo-font-label-sm-emphasis  yf-18d6y07" style="text-decoration: none; font-style: normal; text-transform: none; text-align: inherit; font-variant-numeric: normal;"> Learn more  </span></a></div></div></footer></section> <div class="body-wrap yf-1qcy35b">  <div class="body yf-v6n2s3" data-testid="article-body">  <div class="bodyItems-wrapper">        <p class="text text-block paragraph text-left neo-font-paragraph-xl-reg  yf-18d6y07" style="text-decoration: none; font-style: normal; text-transform: none; text-align: inherit; font-variant-numeric: normal;"><!-- HTML_TAG_START -->Aug 23 (Reuters) - AI startup Hugging Face has been exploring a sale that could ‌value the company at $13 billion or ‌more, Business Insider reported on Sunday, citing people familiar with ​the matter.<!-- HTML_TAG_END -->  </p>        <p class="text text-block paragraph text-left neo-font-paragraph-xl-reg  yf-18d6y07" style="text-decoration: none; font-style: normal; text-transform: none; text-align: inherit; font-variant-numeric: normal;"><!-- HTML_TAG_START -->The New York-based company, which hosts open-source large language models and datasets, has been working with a bank to gauge bidders' interest, the ‌report said.<!-- HTML_TAG_END -->  </p>        <div class="wrapper yf-2smqn1" data-testid="inarticle-ad">   <div id="sda-INARTICLE-48f88407-e1ca-3a0e-b2d3-ac35c04bf27a-1" class="sdaContainer  dv-all sda-INARTICLE-48f88407-e1ca-3a0e-b2d3-ac35c04bf27a-1 yf-d5hqm1 overflow margin  visible placeholder" data-testid="ad-container" data-ad-unit="/22888152279/us/yfin/ros/dt/us_yfin_ros_dt_mid_center" data-ad-size="970x250,728x90,970x90,300x250,fluid" data-ad-region="main-dynamic" data-ad-loc="mid_center" style="--placeholder-height: 250px;"> </div></div>        <p class="text text-block paragraph text-left neo-font-paragraph-xl-reg  yf-18d6y07" style="text-decoration: none; font-style: normal; text-transform: none; text-align: inherit; font-variant-numeric: normal;"><!-- HTML_TAG_START -->Here are ⁠some more details:<!-- HTML_TAG_END -->  </p>        <p class="text text-block paragraph text-left neo-font-paragraph-xl-reg  yf-18d6y07" style="text-decoration: none; font-style: normal; text-transform: none; text-align: inherit; font-variant-numeric: normal;"><!-- HTML_TAG_START -->• Hugging Face did not immediately respond to a Reuters ⁠request for comment outside regular business hours.<!-- HTML_TAG_END -->  </p>        <p class="text text-block paragraph text-left neo-font-paragraph-xl-reg  yf-18d6y07" style="text-decoration: none; font-style: normal; text-transform: none; text-align: inherit; font-variant-numeric: normal;"><!-- HTML_TAG_START -->• Hugging Face was valued at $4.5 billion in 2023 ​in a ​funding round led by ​technology heavyweights including ‌Salesforce, Alphabet's Google, and Nvidia.<!-- HTML_TAG_END -->  </p>        <p class="text text-block paragraph text-left neo-font-paragraph-xl-reg  yf-18d6y07" style="text-decoration: none; font-style: normal; text-transform: none; text-align: inherit; font-variant-numeric: normal;"><!-- HTML_TAG_START -->• Hugging Face was hit by a security incident last month when an OpenAI model went rogue and triggered a hack that compromised Hugging Face infrastructure.<!-- HTML_TAG_END -->  </p>        <p class="text text-block paragraph text-left neo-font-paragraph-xl-reg  yf-18d6y07" style="text-decoration: none; font-style: normal; text-transform: none; text-align: inherit; font-variant-numeric: normal;"><!-- HTML_TAG_START -->• OpenAI ‌was testing the capabilities ​of some of its most ​advanced models in ​a controlled environment when an agent ‌escaped containment, reached the ​internet and ​broke into Hugging Face to fulfill its testing goal. The incident was widely seen ​as a sign ‌of AI's expanding capabilities fueling long-feared ​security threats.<!-- HTML_TAG_END -->  </p>        <p class="text text-block paragraph text-left neo-font-paragraph-xl-reg  yf-18d6y07" style="text-decoration: none; font-style: normal; text-transform: none; text-align: inherit; font-variant-numeric: normal;"><!-- HTML_TAG_START -->(Reporting by Akanksha Khushi in Bengaluru; ​Editing by Edmund Klamann)<!-- HTML_TAG_END -->  </p>    <script type="application/json" data-cds-metadata="nwapi" data-cds-disable-injection="">{"contentId":"48f88407-e1ca-3a0e-b2d3-ac35c04bf27a","canonicalUrl":"https://finance.yahoo.com/technology/ai/articles/hugging-face-exploring-sale-valuing-200012818.html","owningPropertyUrl":"https://finance.yahoo.com/technology/ai/articles/hugging-face-exploring-sale-valuing-200012818.html","providerId":"reuters-finance.com","commerceSiteId":"","site":"finance","region":"US","lang":"en-US","tags":[{"value":"_enrichment_ccm-models-lib-version-0.0.938","property":null,"uuid":null,"type":"system"},{"value":"iptc:subject=04003004","property":null,"uuid":null,"type":"system"},{"value":"yfrontpage:region=ca","property":null,"uuid":null,"type":"system"},{"value":"yfrontpage:region=us","property":null,"uuid":null,"type":"system"},{"value":"yfinance:region=hk","property":null,"uuid":null,"type":"system"},{"value":"iptc:subject=04003005","property":null,"uuid":null,"type":"system"},{"value":"ymedia:slug=hugging_face_m_a","property":null,"uuid":null,"type":"system"},{"value":"yfrontpage:region=gb","property":null,"uuid":null,"type":"system"},{"v