 urging users to rotate any access tokens stored on the platform and review account activity.\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-07-20T12:39:28Z\",\"displayTime\":\"2026-07-20T12:39:28Z\",\"isHosted\":true,\"canonicalUrl\":\"https://tech.yahoo.com/cybersecurity/articles/hugging-face-confirms-breach-affected-123928936.html\",\"clickthroughUrl\":\"https://tech.yahoo.com/cybersecurity/articles/hugging-face-confirms-breach-affected-123928936.html\",\"provider\":{\"displayName\":\"TechCrunch\",\"url\":\"https://techcrunch.com/\",\"providerContentUrl\":\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/07/20/hugging-face-confirms-breach-affected-internal-datasets-and-credentials-urges-users-to-take-action/\",\"providerId\":\"techcrunch_finance_785\"},\"thumbnail\":{\"type\":null,\"originalUrl\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/en/techcrunch_finance_785/6bc63cf2755ac5bc4ea427548987f584\",\"originalHeight\":1330,\"originalWidth\":1995,\"resolutions\":[{\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/747FAF4E96920E0BAA0E0F5DDA40DAF8E7CAD9DEB8DA3EDE09B82EC85E382EE2/subgraphmysterio/resizefill_w194_h109;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Ftechcrunch_finance_785%2F6bc63cf2755ac5bc4ea427548987f584\",\"height\":109,\"width\":194,\"transformLabel\":\"194x109|1|80\"},{\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/C852E0AD9994CE582A6BE15E620B80FEE0671C95AFF59721601E47CB2F33A3E6/subgraphmysterio/resizefill_w388_h218;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Ftechcrunch_finance_785%2F6bc63cf2755ac5bc4ea427548987f584\",\"height\":218,\"width\":388,\"transformLabel\":\"194x109|2|80\"}]},\"mabMeta\":null},\"finance\":null}}},{\"node\":{\"asset\":{\"__typename\":\"Story\",\"id\":\"19a722b5-6135-3337-ae6a-65ce0dc245e1\",\"title\":\"OpenAI says its AI technology acted on its own in an 'unprecedented' hack of another company\",\"previewUrl\":null,\"isPremiumNews\":false,\"contentAttributes\":{\"description\":null,\"summary\":\"ChatGPT maker OpenAI said Tuesday that its artificial intelligence system hacked into another AI company on its own in what the company called an “unprecedented cyber incident.”  “We had a significant security incident during evaluation of our models,” OpenAI CEO Sam Altman said in a statement posted on social media.  AI startup Hugging Face said last week that it had detected an intrusion into its data processing systems that it suspected was caused by an AI agent autonomously acting on its own.\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-07-21T23:44:08Z\",\"displayTime\":\"2026-07-21T23:44:08Z\",\"isHosted\":true,\"canonicalUrl\":\"https://www.yahoo.com/news/science/articles/openai-says-ai-technology-acted-234408361.html\",\"clickthroughUrl\":\"https://www.yahoo.com/news/science/articles/openai-says-ai-technology-acted-234408361.html\",\"provider\":{\"displayName\":\"Associated Press\",\"url\":\"https://apnews.com/\",\"providerContentUrl\":\"https://apnews.com/article/openai-gpt56-sol-hugging-face-63ab84fed5612af04d8a160d60f6def3\",\"providerId\":\"ap.org\"},\"thumbnail\":{\"type\":null,\"originalUrl\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/en/ap.org/ed3241bc0bff4537635dffa2a7f81f81\",\"originalHeight\":3181,\"originalWidth\":4771,\"resolutions\":[{\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/317A36B65AA67F05F3CE20C9AD408A29DEADB6C7736F6CC19D6498DDFC09339D/subgraphmysterio/resizefill_w194_h109;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fap.org%2Fed3241bc0bff4537635dffa2a7f81f81\",\"height\":109,\"width\":194,\"transformLabel\":\"194x109|1|80\"},{\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/8A27AC52950ABA3340615955BE45EDD5A7F5767D1E040FD0D6CC26184266021B/subgraphmysterio/resizefill_w388_h218;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fap.org%2Fed3241bc0bff4537635dffa2a7f81f81\",\"height\":218,\"width\":388,\"transformLabel\":\"194x109|2|80\"}]},\"mabMeta\":null},\"finance\":null}}},{\"node\":{\"asset\":{\"__typename\":\"Story\",\"id\":\"78a62c18-a1ba-3ba8-a42e-44d4aba60cd7\",\"title\":\"OpenAI says its technology, on its own, hacked another AI company\",\"previewUrl\":null,\"isPremiumNews\":false,\"contentAttributes\":{\"description\":null,\"summary\":\"ChatGPT maker OpenAI says its artificial intelligence system hacked into another AI company on its own in what the company called an \\\"unprecedented cyber incident.\\\"\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-07-23T00:10:54Z\",\"displayTime\":\"2026-07-23T00:10:54Z\",\"isHosted\":true,\"canonicalUrl\":\"https://www.cbsnews.com/news/openai-technology-on-its-own-unprecedented-hack-another-ai-company-hugging-face/\",\"clickthroughUrl\":\"https://tech.yahoo.com/cybersecurity/articles/openai-says-technology-own-hacked-105238527.html\",\"provider\":{\"displayName\":\"CBS News\",\"url\":\"https://www.cbsnews.com/\",\"providerContentUrl\":\"https://www.cbsnews.com/news/openai-technology-on-its-own-unprecedented-hack-another-ai-company-hugging-face/\",\"providerId\":\"cbs_news_897\"},\"thumbnail\":{\"type\":null,\"originalUrl\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/en/cbs_news_897/df05b29599f4f1e8d4ff3c42cb854f0b\",\"originalHeight\":1080,\"originalWidth\":1920,\"resolutions\":[{\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/DF90CDCB87C4A42AD685B044FB97A654E916A788CA64433D54CF7D02CDB06CEB/subgraphmysterio/resizefill_w194_h109;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fcbs_news_897%2Fdf05b29599f4f1e8d4ff3c42cb854f0b\",\"height\":109,\"width\":194,\"transformLabel\":\"194x109|1|80\"},{\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/07ED2B7F48001EE7BABD6BFF5397984661A51B1D52606B5AA75B88FD5B6707E2/subgraphmysterio/resizefill_w388_h218;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fcbs_news_897%2Fdf05b29599f4f1e8d4ff3c42cb854f0b\",\"height\":218,\"width\":388,\"transformLabel\":\"194x109|2|80\"}]},\"mabMeta\":null},\"finance\":null}}},{\"node\":{\"asset\":{\"__typename\":\"Story\",\"id\":\"65e9a1d2-3cf8-326e-a4e5-ef7436317ddb\",\"title\":\"Hugging Face says an AI agent carried out an end-to-end cyberattack\",\"previewUrl\":null,\"isPremiumNews\":false,\"contentAttributes\":{\"de