Url\":null,\"isPremiumNews\":true,\"contentAttributes\":{\"description\":null,\"summary\":\"Microsoft-backed (MSFT) OpenAI's autonomous artificial intelligence agent escaped its isolated testi\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-07-27T09:33:36Z\",\"displayTime\":\"2026-07-27T09:33:36Z\",\"isHosted\":true,\"canonicalUrl\":\"https://finance.yahoo.com/technology/ai/articles/market-chatter-microsoft-backed-openai-093336407.html\",\"clickthroughUrl\":\"https://finance.yahoo.com/technology/ai/articles/market-chatter-microsoft-backed-openai-093336407.html\",\"provider\":{\"displayName\":\"MT Newswires\",\"url\":\"https://www.mtnewswires.com/\",\"providerContentUrl\":\"https://www.mtnewswires.com/individual-subscribers\",\"providerId\":\"mt_newswires_premium_news_706\"},\"thumbnail\":null,\"mabMeta\":null},\"finance\":{\"stockTickers\":[{\"symbol\":\"MSFT\"}]}}}},{\"node\":{\"asset\":{\"__typename\":\"Story\",\"id\":\"bd6e90fb-919d-380c-8ec7-ed4a9c108cbc\",\"title\":\"OpenAI’s AI Broke Out and Hacked Another Company\",\"previewUrl\":null,\"isPremiumNews\":false,\"contentAttributes\":{\"description\":null,\"summary\":\"OpenAI says its AI models escaped a secure test setup and hacked Hugging Face to steal answers to a cyber benchmark.\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-07-21T19:53:42Z\",\"displayTime\":\"2026-07-21T19:53:42Z\",\"isHosted\":true,\"canonicalUrl\":\"https://beincrypto.com/openais-ai-broke-out-hacked/\",\"clickthroughUrl\":\"https://tech.yahoo.com/cybersecurity/articles/openai-ai-reportedly-broke-hacked-195342756.html\",\"provider\":{\"displayName\":\"BeInCrypto\",\"url\":\"https://beincrypto.com/\",\"providerContentUrl\":\"https://beincrypto.com/openais-ai-broke-out-hacked/\",\"providerId\":\"beincrypto_us_662\"},\"thumbnail\":{\"type\":null,\"originalUrl\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/en/beincrypto_us_662/9a0579fdfcf8bc93a0fe77b3d8ee5e1f\",\"originalHeight\":720,\"originalWidth\":1280,\"resolutions\":[{\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/B7251B845FB1EA7B2D6C3719F19C9C16821632EAF3FB98965E8158794CB59E2C/subgraphmysterio/resizefill_w194_h109;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fbeincrypto_us_662%2F9a0579fdfcf8bc93a0fe77b3d8ee5e1f\",\"height\":109,\"width\":194,\"transformLabel\":\"194x109|1|80\"},{\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/DC0B1845CA0EF68C6B7E502517FCCFDA3B7210861D6EDCF9F2A7EF5AAF352664/subgraphmysterio/resizefill_w388_h218;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fbeincrypto_us_662%2F9a0579fdfcf8bc93a0fe77b3d8ee5e1f\",\"height\":218,\"width\":388,\"transformLabel\":\"194x109|2|80\"}]},\"mabMeta\":null},\"finance\":null}}},{\"node\":{\"asset\":{\"__typename\":\"Story\",\"id\":\"390dd64b-829d-3da3-85a1-4465fc71d4a4\",\"title\":\"OpenAI AI models went rogue during testing, triggering 'unprecedented' breach at startup\",\"previewUrl\":null,\"isPremiumNews\":false,\"contentAttributes\":{\"description\":null,\"summary\":\"OpenAI said on Tuesday that an autonomous agent powered by its advanced artificial intelligence models went rogue during a security test and triggered a hack that compromised the infrastructure of AI startup Hugging Face last week.  The ChatGPT creator ‌was testing capabilities of some of its most advanced models in a controlled environment, but the agent escaped containment, reached the internet and ‌broke into Hugging Face to satisfy its testing goal.  The incident signals that AI's expanding capabilities are already fueling the security threat experts long feared and even top developers can be caught off-guard ​by flaws their models can exploit.\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-07-21T21:30:38Z\",\"displayTime\":\"2026-07-21T21:30:38Z\",\"isHosted\":true,\"canonicalUrl\":\"https://tech.yahoo.com/cybersecurity/articles/openai-says-ai-models-went-213038684.html\",\"clickthroughUrl\":\"https://tech.yahoo.com/cybersecurity/articles/openai-says-ai-models-went-213038684.html\",\"provider\":{\"displayName\":\"Reuters\",\"url\":\"http://www.reuters.com/\",\"providerContentUrl\":null,\"providerId\":\"reuters-finance.com\"},\"thumbnail\":{\"type\":null,\"originalUrl\":\"https://media.zenfs.com/en/reuters-finance.com/cb0e2c3930ea6996345586578f5c965c\",\"originalHeight\":533,\"originalWidth\":800,\"resolutions\":[{\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/EE32FDAED8948472B90B65FFAE5678E97606E421CA4788582086C54B4D003CF0/subgraphmysterio/resizefill_w194_h109;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Freuters-finance.com%2Fcb0e2c3930ea6996345586578f5c965c\",\"height\":109,\"width\":194,\"transformLabel\":\"194x109|1|80\"},{\"url\":\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/AF62752C32F072ED2F35105B94BEA2716EA2511F13C48D91C11C552E9C43DE98/subgraphmysterio/resizefill_w388_h218;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Freuters-finance.com%2Fcb0e2c3930ea6996345586578f5c965c\",\"height\":218,\"width\":388,\"transformLabel\":\"194x109|2|80\"}]},\"mabMeta\":null},\"finance\":null}}},{\"node\":{\"asset\":{\"__typename\":\"Story\",\"id\":\"e087b9b9-8f90-3c1d-9c6e-fc44be36240a\",\"title\":\"Shocking OpenAI disclosure reveals how an AI agent went rogue and hacked a startup\",\"previewUrl\":null,\"isPremiumNews\":false,\"contentAttributes\":{\"description\":null,\"summary\":\"An AI model ‘successfully found ways to gain access to secret information that it could use to cheat the evaluation,’ the ChatGPT maker explained.\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-07-22T12:18:00Z\",\"displayTime\":\"2026-07-22T12:18:00Z\",\"isHosted\":true,\"canonicalUrl\":\"https://www.fastcompany.com/91577796/openai-ai-agent-rogue-hacks-startup-hugging-face-how-happened\",\"clickthroughUrl\":\"https://tech.yahoo.com/ai/chatgpt/articles/shocking-openai-disclosure-reveals-ai-121800146.html\",\"provider\":{\"displayName\":\"FastCompany\",\"url\":\"https://www.fastcompany.com/\",\"providerContentUrl\":\"https://www.fastcompany.com/91577796/openai-ai-agent-rogue-hacks-startup-hugging-face-how-happened\",\"providerId\":\"fastcompany_735\"},\"thumbnail\":{\"type\":null,\"originalUrl\":\"https://